<view class="page"><view class="hello"><image src="/assets/mascot-avatar.png" class="ai-avatar" mode="aspectFill"/>你好！我是小帐同学 ✨<text>你可以直接告诉我：今天午饭28，打车35</text></view><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id" class="bubble {{item.role}}">{{item.text}}</view><view wx:if="{{drafts.length}}" class="result"><text class="result-title">识别到 {{drafts.length}} 笔账单</text><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="draft"><text>{{item.icon}} {{item.category}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount}}</text></view><button bindtap="confirm">确认记账</button></view><view class="inputbar"><input placeholder="试试说：今天咖啡25" value="{{input}}" bindinput="inputChange" confirm-type="send" bindconfirm="send"/><button bindtap="send">发送</button></view></view>
